[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8700.15, "timestamp": "02:25:00", "text": "好了。我抓到他了。我们的小屋就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8702.67, "timestamp": "02:25:02", "text": "非常低。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8705.99, "timestamp": "02:25:05", "text": "是的。但是，是的，我有一些……呃……在哪儿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8708.87, "timestamp": "02:25:08", "text": "伪造品？呃，我弄到了一些金矿石，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8718.07, "timestamp": "02:25:18", "text": "好了，我们拿到金条了。金子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8720.229, "timestamp": "02:25:20", "text": "现在有了金条，我们就可以打造金斧了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8724.95, "timestamp": "02:25:24", "text": "我们需要五个酒吧。圣。等等，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8726.95, "timestamp": "02:25:26", "text": "有煤吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8735.429, "timestamp": "02:25:35", "text": "好的。嗯，我也弄到了一些金子。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8737.269, "timestamp": "02:25:37", "text": "好了。我把所有黄金都投进去了。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8739.11, "timestamp": "02:25:39", "text": "我去弄点煤来。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8742.03, "timestamp": "02:25:42", "text": "我想这里有一些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8745.269, "timestamp": "02:25:45", "text": "你好。我没看到附近有桦树。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8748.55, "timestamp": "02:25:48", "text": "所以，我们可能得为此去旅行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8758.07, "timestamp": "02:25:58", "text": "是的。再见。"}]